    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/opening-cb3bba24.mp3",
      "bytes": 34560,
      "sha256": "7ed3f2e8e13002e05fd17d74155d528050660c233c6137f46a88844131189f4a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "opening",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "先找回枝头的新芽，陪小黑和无限走过水边的小桥。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/spring-buds-7ddd7540.mp3",
      "bytes": 31536,
      "sha256": "779a1b3b24faff70d6795e14a588f5c4d20ece2df4d4428d2c5dc4d92ba9f7d8",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "spring-buds",
      "speaker": "小黑",
      "text": "师父，树上冒出好多小绿点！它们也睡醒了吗？",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "pitch": "+10Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/bridge-guide-daf241eb.mp3",
      "bytes": 37008,
      "sha256": "3a542e935374f73fb76ba976ac66c4a6d334b460a3a1a79940ea6b604e0c3f58",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "bridge-guide",
      "speaker": "无限",
      "text": "那是新芽。慢慢看，也别忘了脚下的小桥。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "rate": "-18%",
        "pitch": "-26Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/bridge-xiaohei-6132d5ef.mp3",
      "bytes": 27360,
      "sha256": "d37c7b7b33c11f712772daaf1812372d7c09d3f560b46860b97739fb2d6191f4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "bridge-xiaohei",
      "speaker": "小黑",
      "text": "我看着呢！水里的小鱼，也跟我们一起走。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "pitch": "+10Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/spring-stream-4767c78d.mp3",
      "bytes": 31968,
      "sha256": "58423813bb729614968fd480402cdccff719855f36c07d2143748bafbe81e1b4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "spring-stream",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "溪水绕过青石，细细的波纹把春光带向远处。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/complete-18c68bdc.mp3",
      "bytes": 42192,
      "sha256": "88f1d7f33f3f03d6c4d7311eb285163c63339d677db799413f831744b4903bd2",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "complete",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "新芽、小桥和溪水都回来了。小黑发现，春天已经走到身边。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/opening-9a82e126.mp3",
      "bytes": 32112,
      "sha256": "550811e8ae3995c724fa7c411cde8b8eda8999be46a2f281d1b8b4a63ff06f6a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "opening",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "先拼出柳枝上的两只小鸟，看看小黑正指着哪里。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/willow-birds-e234b3ad.mp3",
      "bytes": 31680,
      "sha256": "d5dcdcf76dc149aec5b470fa51c4848750b7d7fe30448c1acd6166392712c623",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "willow-birds",
      "speaker": "小黑",
      "text": "师父，看上面！两只小鸟，会不会也在聊天？",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "pitch": "+10Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/willow-leaves-6529135f.mp3",
      "bytes": 29520,
      "sha256": "abd42e2ed29fe437aac99904cad2d4ac47df1e9f6df4e3cdd29a58902de02172",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "willow-leaves",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "长长的柳条垂下来，嫩叶在风里轻轻摆动。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/willow-guide-b02594e5.mp3",
      "bytes": 34272,
      "sha256": "1227ab9c8a1b8a509d6c6f312c95156b94aee567f4a5ef3480ffbd3191b3b517",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "willow-guide",
      "speaker": "无限",
      "text": "我们轻一点。站在这里，已经看得很清楚了。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "rate": "-18%",
        "pitch": "-26Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/willow-xiaohei-554c605c.mp3",
      "bytes": 26928,
      "sha256": "fa0d8b870184914af3b9106d107250df3cd09310c7f799e08875b71151d9b63d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "willow-xiaohei",
      "speaker": "小黑",
      "text": "好，我小小声。小鸟，你们好呀。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "pitch": "+10Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/complete-de11f171.mp3",
      "bytes": 37584,
      "sha256": "376ecd6b5f98ff7c55daf767d590157f5e4596bc24935b48f82d948e1de03862",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "complete",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "柳叶轻轻摇着。小黑仰着头，把枝头的小鸟看了又看。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/opening-e1fff4c7.mp3",
      "bytes": 35712,
      "sha256": "00f0898cea9a76dabf8333a58714315828951b4348d34cae721b73dc111fbd7e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "opening",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "先找回树枝上睡着的小黑，让这段树荫下的午后慢下来。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/sleeping-xiaohei-59925e30.mp3",
      "bytes": 32832,
      "sha256": "a55f01bb74ff990c646319cff960b898ce159feeada06a437a0d0ec23e84ac25",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "sleeping-xiaohei",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "小黑趴在树枝上睡着了，长长的尾巴也安静下来。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/roof-guide-7444dc9.mp3",
      "bytes": 30816,
      "sha256": "721d5382851b3bda8a91bb426909078db9a36f4e505bc9b57c3e8f0ea2f3b2df",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "roof-guide",
      "speaker": "无限",
      "text": "睡吧。等你醒了，我们再慢慢走。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "rate": "-18%",
        "pitch": "-26Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/green-canopy-5957f00b.mp3",
      "bytes": 27504,
      "sha256": "aacc1f9109d7ab45d658dae06e385b86d61b2cf68bbbf8a0c810360cc68b25c4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "green-canopy",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "一层一层的绿叶，把屋顶上的光筛得柔柔的。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/green-roof-a113f672.mp3",
      "bytes": 33408,
      "sha256": "7f8db2b770071b265e1df8677c37a07fb429bdfe32bfe58979157ae01b1e5532",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "green-roof",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "树枝伸过青绿的屋瓦，安静的午后有了歇脚的地方。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/complete-a5ee75dd.mp3",
      "bytes": 40032,
      "sha256": "dd8997c9427934233347c8e73f3b8099ad84c5e8d9fde530613572ab2e71a91f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "complete",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "屋瓦和树荫都拼好了。小黑还在睡，无限把这一刻留得很轻。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/opening-c41dbcc1.mp3",
      "bytes": 27072,
      "sha256": "014a47d2d5217878aab272446caf21ce3bbd2e1afa9b5f530d605e491b92b5a5",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "opening",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "先拼出雨伞，给小黑和无限挡一挡雨。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
        "rate": "-8%",
        "pitch": "+0Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/umbrella-e706bbb5.mp3",
      "bytes": 21888,
      "sha256": "759e01439435f06c81ae37952b18ec061a8e7ac78b3f4271c0fb187a1505e878",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "umbrella",
      "speaker": "无限",
      "text": "靠近一点，雨就淋不到了。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "rate": "-18%",
        "pitch": "-26Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/wuxian-a2f114c9.mp3",
      "bytes": 32976,
      "sha256": "c7343ca682dfb59197712019cd01d6e3c85664f41328c70dd127b8c882d2d473",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "wuxian",
      "speaker": "无限",
      "text": "不赶时间。你想看，就再看一会儿。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
        "rate": "-18%",
        "pitch": "-26Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/xiaohei-4e91deb6.mp3",
      "bytes": 28224,
      "sha256": "42c307aa9702744ff9a2cb865d2b283b6c46a04c5d366fad9760c279cfd23d58",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "xiaohei",
      "speaker": "小黑",
      "text": "师父，你看！叶子上有一颗小小的天空。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "pitch": "+10Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/grass-449e7bce.mp3",
      "bytes": 29088,
      "sha256": "f8328fa49c4bac9e91035648f0db8a5d29be14837894d097d0cf447cb74aa700",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "grass",
      "speaker": "小黑",
      "text": "嘘——别动。让它在叶子上，再待一小会儿。",
      "synthesis": {
        "provider": "Microsoft Edge online TTS via edge-tts",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiaNeural",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "pitch": "+10Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "path": "/audio/dialogue/complete-ffdbb01.mp3",
      "bytes": 33408,
      "sha256": "edf7bb9801fee32c07c82203362ce62190c147c59229ea6706fc1fde4bf5e957",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "cue": "complete",
      "speaker": "春日旁白",
      "text": "伞下的小路拼好了。他们慢慢走，听了一路的雨。",
